          "text": "<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">Hello everybody!</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">Recently i've been working on implement the foundation for introduction to Chapters!</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">Right now the main loop is ready to go and the only things that is not in Version 0.6.2 is the Map and the Story for Chapter 2.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">Things reworked / updated / introduced in Version 0.6.2:</p><ul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px 24px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"><li>New Chapter Select Monitor / Screen (In wich you can select what chapters you can play, only Chapter 1 is visible).</li><li>Reworked some aspects of the Player HUD - Added an BodyCam recording icon + little informations.</li><li>Implemented the AmbientSounds in the Forest area (If the sounds are not working / not hearing them let me know).</li><li>Reworked the Main Menu icons and added the IndieDB logo + link to the project.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">In the next update, Version 0.6.3 i will add an Head Bobbing Slider (To stop or lower the Head Bobbing sway)</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">The Chapter 1, might get a rework after the foundations is set for the Chapter 2 (Might improve some aspects on in-game items and or story).</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"><iframe height=\"165\" width=\"550\" src=\"https://itch.io/embed/4641433?border_width=0&amp;bg_color=000000&amp;fg_color=ffffff&amp;link_color=ffffff&amp;border_color=000000\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; color: rgb(238, 238, 238); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">Thank you!</p><!--EndFragment-->",
